131
00:18:07,384 --> 00:18:09,488
<i>O seu brilho vinha
de dentro.</i>

132
00:18:10,688 --> 00:18:14,693
<i>Uma luz fantasmagórica,
de cor esmeralda.</i>

133
00:18:16,494 --> 00:18:20,299
